Description: Standalone COSMIC panel applet that cycles through chosen COSMIC themes
 A COSMIC panel applet that cycles the desktop theme through the COSMIC themes
 you choose: left-click for the next one, right-click to choose them and to
 preview a theme by resting the pointer on it. It changes only the theme and
 COSMIC's light/dark setting to match, never the wallpaper, and installs beside
 the stock COSMIC applets, replacing none of them.

